--[[
    STAFF CHECK + TAP x25  (v2 - accurate detection)
    =============================================================
    • Tap multiplier x25 (~50 CPS, burst then replay)
    • Higher-up detection:
        1) Game creator (user-owned)               -> OWNER
        2) Game's own creator group rank >= 255    -> OWNER
        3) Game's own creator group rank >= 200    -> ADMIN
        4) Game's own creator group rank >= 100    -> MOD
        5) Extra groups (configurable thresholds)  -> OWNER/ADMIN/MOD
        6) KnownStaff map (manual override)        -> any level
        7) Strict admin-tool names (HD Admin, Adonis, Kohl's, Cmdr, BAE)
        8) Roblox staff check (OFF by default — unreliable)
    • NO team-name scanning, NO keyword tool matching, NO GetRankInGroup(1)
      spam — these were the main sources of false "higher-up" claims.
    • Red cham (Highlight) + floating rank icon above head
    • Separate "Higher Up Chams" toggle so detection (notifications) and
      visuals can be controlled independently.
    • Warns "No higher-ups detected in this server" when none found.
]]

